Step 6: Commit Offset
=============================================================================================

After successful processing:

consumer.commitSync();


Kafka stores:

Last Processed Offset = 103


Actually Kafka saves:

Offset = 104


Meaning:

Start from 104 next time

Why Commit Offset?

Without commit:

Consumer Restart


Kafka wouldn't know where to resume.

Example:

Processed upto Offset 103

Commit 104


Restart:

Starts From 104
